        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(model-fallback): re-throw LiveSessionModelSwitchError for outer retry loop (#101676)",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWhen a user changes the model mid-turn (via `/model`, session_status model override, or cron job override) while the AI is actively generating a response, the run terminates with an error instead of retrying the turn against the newly-selected model.\n\n**Evidence from the issue (#101676):**\n```\ninfo: live session model switch requested: claude-sonnet-5 -> claude-sonnet-4-6\nwarn: model_fallback_decision decision=candidate_failed ... fallbackConfigured=false\nerror: Embedded agent failed before reply: Live session model switch requested\n```\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe `runWithModelFallback` loop catches `LiveSessionModelSwitchError` from the embedded runner. When the switch target is not a later fallback candidate, it was wrapping the error as `FailoverError` instead of letting it propagate to the outer retry loop. With no fallbacks configured, this reached `throwFallbackFailureSummary` producing `FallbackSummaryError` — not `LiveSessionModelSwitchError` — so the outer loop never caught it.\n\n**Fix:** When the switch target is not in the candidate list at all (a genuine user-requested switch to a new model), re-throw `LiveSessionModelSwitchError` so the outer retry loop can restart with the new model. When the switch target IS in the candidate list but at a same/earlier position (a stale fallback-conflict switch), preserve the existing failover behavior so the fallback chain can advance to configured candidates.\n\nThe outer loop has bounded retries (`MAX_LIVE_SWITCH_RETRIES = 5` for subagents, `2` for main agent), preventing infinite loops. The existing `findLiveSessionModelSwitchRedirectIndex` redirect-to-later-candidate behavior is preserved unchanged.\n\nRisk note: this touches the agent live-switch/fallback boundary. The stale-switch guard from #58496 is preserved via the `isLiveSessionModelSwitchTargetInCandidates` check.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Live Behavior Proof\n\nThe fix is at the control-flow boundary of `runWithModelFallback`. Source-level verification of the three branches:\n\n**Branch 1 — switch target is a later fallback candidate (redirect, unchanged):**\n```\nrunWithModelFallback(primary=\"openai/gpt-4.1-mini\", fallbacks=[\"anthropic/claude-haiku-3-5\", \"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6\"])\n  → candidate 0 (gpt-4.1-mini) throws LiveSessionModelSwitchError(claude-sonnet-4-6)\n  → findLiveSessionModelSwitchRedirectIndex finds claude-sonnet-4-6 at index 2\n  → redirects to index 2, skips haiku ✓\n```\n\n**Branch 2 — switch target NOT in candidates (rethrow for #101676):**\n```\nrunWithModelFallback(primary=\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6\", fallbacks=[])\n  → candidate 0 throws LiveSessionModelSwitchError(openrouter/deepseek-chat)\n  → findLiveSessionModelSwitchRedirectIndex returns null (no later candidates)\n  → isLiveSessionModelSwitchTargetInCandidates returns false\n  → re-throws LiveSessionModelSwitchError → outer loop retries ✓\n```\n\n**Branch 3 — stale switch target IS in candidates (failover preserved from #58496):**\n```\nrunWithModelFallback(primary=\"openai/gpt-4.1-mini\", fallbacks=[\"anthropic/claude-haiku-3-5\"])\n  → candidate 0 throws LiveSessionModelSwitchError(gpt-4.1-mini) [same as current]\n  → findLiveSessionModelSwitchRedirectIndex returns null\n  → isLiveSessionModelSwitchTargetInCandidates returns true (in list at index 0)\n  → wraps as FailoverError, continues to haiku → haiku succeeds ✓\n```\n\n### Focused Tests\n\n```\npnpm test src/agents/model-fallback.test.ts       → 232 passed ✓\npnpm test src/agents/live-model-switch.test.ts    → 42 passed ✓\npnpm test src/agents/agent-command.live-model-switch.test.ts → 148 passed ✓\n```\n\n### Static Checks\n\n```\npnpm exec oxfmt --check src/agents/model-fallback.ts src/agents/model-fallback.test.ts → passed ✓\ngit diff --check → passed ✓\n```\n\n### Changes\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `src/agents/model-fallback.ts` | +32 / -4 lines — add `isLiveSessionModelSwitchTargetInCandidates`, narrow rethrow |\n| `src/agents/model-fallback.test.ts` | +47 / -18 lines — update 2 tests, restore 1 stale-switch test, add 2 new tests |\n\nCloses #101676.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
        "branch": "fix/live-model-switch-mid-attempt-101676",
